ompt says \"sweep these areas before release\" and \"Changed in this build\" lists 4 changes. Usually in these tasks, bugs are in the changed features (regressions). But could be elsewhere too.\n\nLet me test a few more high-value behaviors:\n\n1. Browser search \"Search all decks\" action.\n2. Sorting by Deck/column.\n3. Rotation of browser.\n4. Deck list after rotation/collapse already done.\n\nLet me test search all decks: currently search tag:verb within Spanish shows comer, with \"Search all decks\" action. Type a query for a French card e.g., \"bonjour\" while Spanish filter → \"No cards found in deck Spanish\" with Search all decks button; tap → should show bonjour. Let me test. Currently search field has tag:verb. I'll clear and type bonjour.\n\nActually the search results currently show comer. Let me set query \"bonjour\". type_text clears first, submit true."}
